1
00:00:00,918 --> 00:00:03,045
I asked Wonho to leave
before you come

2
00:00:03,170 --> 00:00:04,850
I thought it'd be better
to talk in private

3
00:00:07,883 --> 00:00:10,761
What did the
production team say?

4
00:00:10,886 --> 00:00:12,596
At first, there was
a storm of protest

5
00:00:14,264 --> 00:00:15,640
But later, it went viral

6
00:00:15,724 --> 00:00:17,601
and the viewership
reached the highest

7
00:00:17,726 --> 00:00:19,019
so they didn't protest
anymore

8
00:00:20,187 --> 00:00:22,147
We only have a few more
episodes left anyway

9
00:00:26,026 --> 00:00:29,905
Still, stay away from
that guy or Shin Yoo-il

10
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:31,230
Keep your head down
for a while

11
00:00:32,032 --> 00:00:33,032
For how long?

12
00:00:33,075 --> 00:00:34,826
Do whatever you want
with that friend

13
00:00:35,953 --> 00:00:37,162
And Shin Yoo-il…

14
00:00:38,497 --> 00:00:40,749
You'd better not
see him anymore

15
00:00:40,874 --> 00:00:42,125
Ma'am

16
00:00:45,003 --> 00:00:48,674
if there were
no scandal like that

17
00:00:50,217 --> 00:00:51,677
would this not
have happened now?

18
00:00:51,802 --> 00:00:52,886
No

19
00:00:53,011 --> 00:00:55,138
That was the condition
in the first place

20
00:00:59,685 --> 00:01:00,685
I'll go ahead

21
00:01:03,605 --> 00:01:04,605
Wait

22
00:01:12,364 --> 00:01:13,448
I'm sorry

23
00:01:16,868 --> 00:01:18,108
You can stay
as long as you want

24
00:01:45,022 --> 00:01:48,900
[Shindecent]
[Yoo-il…]
